# Real household config. The runner stage copies named paths and never picks
# this up, so it does not reach the published image — but `COPY . .` in the
# builder puts it in the build context and into an intermediate layer, and one
# careless `COPY --from=builder /app/config` later would ship it. Keep it out
# of the context entirely. config/dashboard.example.json is still copied in.
